{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmyrG7FR9sjcn2VUD1q8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Second screen. At the top: \"חשבון ניירות ערך\", \"בניהול אישי\". That's for people who manage things themselves. Not for me.\n\"במה הכסף מושקע\". \"מזומן שקלי\": \"כסף בשקלים שמרוויח ריבית לטווח קצר, בעו\"ש, בפיקדון…\". Fine, that's my money.\n\"קרן כספית\": \"קרן נאמנות שמשקיעה רק בנכסים קצרי טווח עם סיכון נמוך… כמו מק\"מ ופיקדונות בנקאיים\". Aha, so it's a קרן נאמנות. My fund that fell was also a קרן נאמנות… but it says \"סיכון נמוך\" and \"פיקדונות\". Hmm.\nThere are two small buttons on it, \"יומית\" and \"מתחדשת\". What are they? I don't know.\n\"מק\"מ\": \"הלוואה קצרה למדינה, עד שנה, שבנק ישראל מוכר לציבור\". The state, Bank of Israel. That sounds safe.\n\"איגרות חוב ממשלתיות\": \"המדינה מחזירה את הסכום במועד שנקבע\". That's government bonds, which I know are safe.\nAfter that come the cards \"מדד MSCI…\", \"S&P 500\", \"נאסד\"ק\", \"ת\"א-125\". Shares and English letters. Every card says the same thing again: \"הכסף מושקע בשקלים דרך קרן שעוקבת אחריו, עם חשיפה לדולר או מנוטרלת ממנו\". Not for me, I skip them.\nAt the bottom: \"אתר אישי, לא מסחרי\". So it isn't a bank. I don't know who these people are.\nAnd I didn't see anywhere how much each one gives, or how much the bank takes.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\"Look, I didn't decide anything. I'm not giving money to anything I read there. It's some private site, it says 'אתר אישי', not a bank. It explains what each thing is, but not how much it pays or how much the bank takes. I found three names that sound almost as safe as a deposit: מק\"מ, which is a short loan to the state from Bank of Israel; government bonds; and something called 'קרן כספית', which it says is low risk and holds deposits and מק\"מ. But it's a קרן נאמנות, and you know what happened to me with one of those. I want to ask you, and the clerk, about מק\"מ and קרן כספית. Is it better than my deposit, and what do they charge?\"\n\n**What I looked at:** the opening and \"שני חלקים\", \"מאיפה להתחיל\", the deposits and savings plans, קופת גמל להשקעה, and on the second screen מזומן, קרן כספית, מק\"מ and government bonds.\n**What I skipped:** pension, children, \"בניהול אישי\", and all the מדד cards with English letters.\n**What I didn't understand:** מק\"ם and קרן כספית at first, \"מדד מניות\", \"יומית\" and \"מתחדשת\", \"חשיפה לדולר או מנוטרלת\", MSCI, S&P.\n**What bothered me:** the black screen is hard on the eyes. The line in grey letters at the top was too small to read. The index cards all repeat the same sentence. And there isn't a single number about the return or the fees."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3679,"cache_read_input_tokens":7694,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3679},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04f4d975-3bad-4cf8-bdc8-b166b267a78f","uuid":"954af4a8-823f-4ab5-a72b-ef5bb6386277","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:21:45.234Z","request_id":"req_011CgmyrFsrBE9AdAEzDrwnj"}
